{"tool_name":"rbinds","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"rbinds","home":"http://zhaoserver.com.cn/RBinds/RBinds.html","license":"Not licensed","summary":"A user-friendly server for RNA binding site prediction.","addition_date":"2021-10-24T18:39:40.825374Z","last_update_date":"2021-10-24T18:39:40.829179Z","tool_type":["Bioinformatics portal","Web application"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:rbinds","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"huiwenwang@mails.ccnu.edu.cn","name":"Huiwen Wang"},{"email":"yjzhaowh@mail.ccnu.edu.cn","name":"Yunjie Zhao","typeEntity":"Person"}],"documentation":[{"type":["User manual"],"url":"http://zhaoserver.com.cn/RBinds/RBinds.html"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Network visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3925"},{"term":"Protein-protein binding site prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2464"},{"term":"RNA binding site prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3902"},{"term":"RNA secondary structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0278"},{"term":"RNA structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2441"}]}],"name":"RBinds","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Jennifer","publication":[{"doi":"10.1016/J.CSBJ.2020.10.043","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2020 The Author(s)RNA performs various biological functions by interacting with other molecules. The knowledge of RNA binding sites is essential for the understanding of RNA-protein or RNA-ligand complex structures and their mechanisms. However, the RNA binding site prediction study requires tedious programming scripts and manual handling. One user-friendly bioinformatics tool for RNA binding site prediction has been missing. This limitation motivated us to develop the RBinds, a user-friendly web server, to predict the RNA binding site using a simple graphical user interface. Some advanced features implemented in RBinds are (1) transforming the RNA structure to a network automatically; (2) analyzing the structural network properties to predict binding site; (3) constructing one annotated force-directed network; (4) providing a visualization tool for users to scale and rotate the structure; (5) offering the related tools to predict or simulate RNA structures. RBinds web server is a reliable and user-friendly tool and facilitates the RNA binding site study without installing programs locally. RBinds is freely accessible at http://zhaoserver.com.cn/RBinds/RBinds.html.","authors":[{"name":"Wang H."},{"name":"Zhao Y."}],"citationCount":2,"date":"2020-01-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Computational and Structural Biotechnology Journal","title":"RBinds: A user-friendly server for RNA binding site prediction"},"pmcid":"PMC8164131","pmid":"34136090"}],"topic":[{"term":"Molecular biology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3047"},{"term":"Nucleic acid structure analysis","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0097"},{"term":"RNA","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0099"},{"term":"RNA immunoprecipitation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794"},{"term":"Structure prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0082"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"RBinds","home":"https://bio.tools/rbinds","license":"Not licensed","summary":"A user-friendly server for RNA binding site prediction.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:rbinds/cmd/zhaoserver.com.cn","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"documentation":{"manual":true},"license":{"open_source":false,"osi":false},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":8,"citations":[{"count":1,"year":"2021"},{"count":1,"year":"2026"},{"count":2,"year":"2022"},{"count":2,"year":"2024"},{"count":2,"year":"2025"}],"doi":"10.1016/